      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792500000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Une capability = une ou deux méthodes du plugin :\nTIMETABLE → getWeeklyTimetable · HOMEWORK → getHomeworks, setHomeworkCompletion\nGRADES → getGradesPeriods, getGradesForPeriod · NEWS → getNews, setNewsAsAcknowledged\nATTENDANCE → getAttendancePeriods, getAttendanceForPeriod · CANTEEN_MENU → getWeeklyCanteenMenu\nCANTEEN_BALANCE / HISTORY / BOOKINGS → getCanteenBalances, getCanteenTransactionsHistory,\ngetCanteenBookingWeek, setMealAsBooked",
      "originalText": "Une capability = une ou deux méthodes du plugin :\nTIMETABLE → getWeeklyTimetable · HOMEWORK → getHomeworks, setHomeworkCompletion\nGRADES → getGradesPeriods, getGradesForPeriod · NEWS → getNews, setNewsAsAcknowledged\nATTENDANCE → getAttendancePeriods, getAttendanceForPeriod · CANTEEN_MENU → getWeeklyCanteenMenu\nCANTEEN_BALANCE / HISTORY / BOOKINGS → getCanteenBalances, getCanteenTransactionsHistory,\ngetCanteenBookingWeek, setMealAsBooked",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iFpuE0PaolqEellf2F6wC",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
