      "updated": 1792500000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "pieride/\n  src/                    interface + cœur métier (TypeScript)\n    app/                  fenêtre, barre latérale, routeur\n    modules/              une page = un module (registry.ts)\n    components/           kit d'interface (design system)\n    hooks/                hooks de données (lisent SQLite)\n    services/\n      shared/             types, Capabilities, SchoolServicePlugin\n      account-manager.ts  point d'entrée unique\n      pronote/  ecoledirecte/  skolengo/  appscho/\n      multi/  ical/  turboself/  ard/  izly/  alise/\n    database/             schéma Drizzle, migrations\n    stores/               Zustand\n    lib/                  réseau (fetch), keyring, logger\n    locales/              fr.json, en.json\n  src-tauri/              Rust\n    src/                  main.rs + commandes (keyring, ENT, tray)\n    capabilities/         permissions (domaines, commandes)\n    icons/                générées depuis brand/logo\n    tauri.conf.json\n  docs/                   architecture (ce schéma), modules\n  .github/workflows/      CI : lint, tests, builds Win / macOS / Linux",
      "originalText": "pieride/\n  src/                    interface + cœur métier (TypeScript)\n    app/                  fenêtre, barre latérale, routeur\n    modules/              une page = un module (registry.ts)\n    components/           kit d'interface (design system)\n    hooks/                hooks de données (lisent SQLite)\n    services/\n      shared/             types, Capabilities, SchoolServicePlugin\n      account-manager.ts  point d'entrée unique\n      pronote/  ecoledirecte/  skolengo/  appscho/\n      multi/  ical/  turboself/  ard/  izly/  alise/\n    database/             schéma Drizzle, migrations\n    stores/               Zustand\n    lib/                  réseau (fetch), keyring, logger\n    locales/              fr.json, en.json\n  src-tauri/              Rust\n    src/                  main.rs + commandes (keyring, ENT, tray)\n    capabilities/         permissions (domaines, commandes)\n    icons/                générées depuis brand/logo\n    tauri.conf.json\n  docs/                   architecture (ce schéma), modules\n  .github/workflows/      CI : lint, tests, builds Win / macOS / Linux",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "yxeCYztggBNCcCJIjFjb4",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
